Opos o Dantes, etsi kai o eroas autou tou bibliou diatrekhei ennea kuklous pou antistoikhoun se isarithma amartemata kai poines, kai einai organomenoi san mia akhanes bibliotheke. Omos, s' aute te bibliotheke-kolase uparkhei mono enas daimonas-bibliothekarios, kai oi kolasmenoi einai ta idia ta biblia. Isos, pali, o monadikos kolasmenos na einai o amekhanos eroas (kai, mazi m' auton, o anagnostes) pou brisketai egkleistos sten kolase, antimetopos me ena Diabolo kat' eikona kai omoiose tou."�
�O Argures Liodes oute ste mese tou pouthena, dikhos xena aphtia paronta, mporouse na phonaxei ta onomata ton exi, na tous simosei mazemenous, na tous koitaxei epitelous katamata, gia na labei te duname kai na tolmesei esto duo logia gia ta xera gegonota.
Duo logia gia ta xera gegonota den epikheirese oute se argoporemenes epistoles, giati sto parelthon opote lipopsukhouse kai ethele natous ta grapsei, telika lipopsukhouse kai sten idea tou grammenou khartiou.
Tha tou eleipan kai ta blemmata tous molis mathainan, ki autos eikhe ten elpida kai ten anagke na kourniasei sta matia tous.
Alla epi eikosi ennia khronia exi alla zeugaria matia ton empodizan, ola skoteines kopies tou sumbolaiou me tis ephta, mazi me te dike tou, upographes, na men patethei o orkos siopes ekeines tes nukhtas."�

�
O kathegetes tes Istorias Gkrakham Khentrik egkateleipse te gunaika tou ten Mparmpara gia khare tes gemates zontania Ann kai einai kati perissotero apo eukharistemenos me ten kainourgia tou zoe. Auta omos mekhri te mera pou anakaluptei to parelthon tes Ann ston kinematographo os metrias ethopoiou. Prin perasei polus khronos, o Gkrakham ekhei pesei me ta moutra sten anazetese palion ikhnon, psakhnontas sta biblia tes tis aphieroseis proen eraston, pegainontas sukhna sto sinema kai entruphontas stis palies tainies opou ekeine eikhe emphanistei. Den katalogizei sten Ann oti eikhe kapoio parelthon prin gnoristoun, ela omos pou e istoria einai kati pou anekathen ton endiephere...
"Milao gia te zelia" eipe o Gkrakham apotoma. Meta, prospathontas na phanei prothumos na boethesei, sumplerose: "Ten erotike zelia".
"Den uparkhei ki alle, ek peiras to leo. Mmmm. Lupamai pou to akouo auto. Oste e mikre paizei me te photia, e; Pote den mporeis na xereis, auto leo ego. Pote den xereis ti ekheis parei, para mono otan einai polu arga kai tote oute psullos ston korpho sou". Perimene na sunekhisei o Gkrakham.
"Okhi, den einai auto. Doxa to Theo. Auto tha etan phobero. Phobero. Einai kati perissotero... anadromiko, entelos anadromiko. Ekhei na kanei me tous tupous pou proegethekan. Prin ekeine me gnorisei.""�
�Ena koritsaki sto Ouaiomingk mporei na diabazei ta pio skoteina mustika ton anthropon apo ton tropo pou stauronoun ta kheria tous. Ste Nea Uorke, enas antras khresimopoiei te diaisthese tou gia na problepsei ten poreia tou Khrematisteriou, kerdizontas 300 dis. dolaria. Sto Sikago, mia gunaika mporei na ginetai aorate, me to na steketai kai na kineitai sta semeia opou den koitazei kaneis. Prokeitai gia tous <>. Apo to 1980 kai meta, enas stous ekato anthropous gennietai me mia idiaitere ikanoteta pou ton katatassei s' aute ten kategoria. O Nik Kouper einai omospondiakos praktoras kai diathetei ena kharisma to opoio tou epitrepei na katadiokei tromokrates me aparamille epitukhia. O neos tou Stokhos einai isos o pio epikindunos en zoe tromokrates* enas Kharismatikos boutegmenos sto aima, apophasismenos na xekinesei enan neo emphulio polemo. Gia na ton piasei, omos, o Kouper tha prepei na aparnethei ola osa pisteuei kai na prodosei tous omoious tou.
O Markous Seiki, "enas sugkhronos metr tou saspens" (Chicago Sun-Times) kai "enas apo tous kaluterous aphegetes pou diathetoume" (Michael Connelly), graphei ena biblio peripeteias pou sunduazei tous kataigistikous ruthmous tou thriler me te dieisdutike koinonike kritike. Prokeitai gia mia sunarpastike aphegese, e opoia aphora enan kosmo entelos diaphoretiko alla kai tromaktika omoio me ton diko mas* enan kosmo opou to na gennetheis kharismatikos mporei na ginei mia phobere katara."�
�To 1920, o Giozeph Rot, o pio diasemos germanophonos antapokrites tes epokhes tou, ephtase sto Berolino. Ta arthra tou gia auto epereasan mia oloklere genia suggrapheon, anamesa tous kai ton Tomas Mann. Antekhoun tous biaious koinonikous kai politikous paroxusmous pou adiakopa apeilousan ten euthrauste Demokratia tes Baimares.
O Rot kinetheke piso apo to parapetasma tes pio xakoustes metropoles tes epokhes tes tzaz, opos den ekane kanenas allos Germanos suggrapheas tes epokhes tou. Egine o khronikographos tes zoes ton katoikon tes pou etan xekhasmenoi apo olous: anaperoi tou Protou Pagkosmiou polemou, Ebraioi metanastes apo ten Anatolike Europe pou katekluzan ten pole, astegoi sta asula, astoi sta demosia loutra, ola ta anonuma ptomata sta nekrotomeia, eno tautokhrona periegrapse tis pio phantasmagorikes opseis tes proteuousas, tous demosious kepous kai tis meiktes pisines, ta trena kai ta tram, tous ouranoxustes kai ten anaduomene biomekhania tou theamatos. Antilephtheke apo tous protous te diaphainomene apeile tou nazistikou kommatos, pou telika tha ton odegesei sten anagkastike uperoria. Gi' auto eikhe balthei na khartographesei to topio tes ethikes khreokopias kai tes apateles omorphias tes poles, kai na mas dosei ena aparamillo portraito tes se mia stigme kombike gia ten Istoria tes.
O Rot epiase to sphugmo tes Europes auton ton abebaion emeron pou proegethekan tes megales katarreuses mias epeirou kai tou khamou enos oloklerou politismou.
To teleutaio sugklonistiko keimeno, "To Auto-da-fe tou pneumatos", grammeno to 1933, milaei akribos gia to kapsimo ton biblion apo tous Nazi exo apo to Raikhstagk kai ten tragike these ton suggrapheon pou katargetheke to ergo tous ste metrike tous glossa.
(Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)
To biblio auto prospherei megale apolause khoris na katapheugei se pseudeis entuposeis e prokataskeuasmenes skepseis. Tha mporousa na paratheso xekhorista kathe phrase tou gia na ektheiaso ten asteireute diaugeia tou, ten akatamakhete goeteia tou kai ten adiatarakhte sunokhe tou.
(Jeffrey Eugenides, New York Times)"�	
�	O Ntok Sportelo ekhei polu kairo na dei ten proen tou. Kai xaphnika ekeine emphanizetai apo to pouthena ki arkhizei na tou leei gia ena skhedio apagoges enos zaploutou megaloergolabou, ton opoio tukhainei na agapaei. Eukola logia. Einai to telos tes psukhedelikes dekaetias tou '60 sto Los Antzeles, kai o Ntok xerei oti e agape einai aplos mia lexe tou surmou, opos to tripaki kai to phina, mono pou e sugkekrimene lexe demiourgei sunethos problemata. Par' ola auta, se ligo brisketai mplegmenos se ena allokoto koubari apo kinetra kai pathe, me protagonistes serphades, pornes, mastouredes kai rokades, enan epikinduno tokoglupho, enan saxophonista se rolo mustikou praktora, enan proen phulakismeno pou ekhei tatouaz mia sbastika sto kephali kai pou latreuei ten Ethel Merman, kai mia musteriode organose gnoste os Khrusos Kunodontas, e opoia mporei kai na einai aplos mia kompina pou estesan kapoioi odontiatroi gia na xegelasoun ten ephoria.
Se aute te zoere aphegese, kai se ena asunethisto gi' auton logotekhniko eidos, o Tomas Pintson zontaneuei me klasiko tropo te rese oti an thumasai te dekaetia tou '60, tote den ten ezeses... e mallon... an ten ezeses, tote... e, gia stasou, mepos..."�	
�	Mia neare gunaika kai o apistos suzugos tes sumphonoun oti o gamos tous ekhei teleiosei. Apophasizoun na men apokalupsoun se kanenan ton khorismo tous. Omos mia mera, kai eno e gunaika ekhei prokhoresei pia ste zoe tes, mathainei oti o Kristopher, o anthropos pou paramenei tupika suzugos tes, ekhei exaphanistei. Eikhe metabei ston Gerolimena tes Manes, opou ekane ereuna pano stis moirologistres tes periokhes, gia to epomeno biblio tou.
Paroti e eroida amphitalanteuetai, telika apophasizei na taxidepsei sten Ellada.
Meteore psukhologika kai sunaisthematika sto agrio periballon tes Manes, anazeta ta aitia pou odegesan ton gamo tes se apotukhia, suneidetopoiontas parallela poso liga gnorize pragmatika gia ton antra pou agapouse.
Mia istoria gia ten apistia kai te sumponia, gia ten apostase pou mas khorizei apo tis zoes ton allon kai gia tis aphegeseis pou epinooume gia na krupsoume ta alethina mas aisthemata.
Kathos e eroida epanexetazei ton erota tes gia enan antra pou isos na men etan autos pou edeikhne, e Keiti Kitamoura mas eisagei sten empeiria mias gunaikas pou brisketai sta prothura tes katarreuses.
Ena aristourgematiko muthistorema me phonto te Mane, pou tha sugklonisei ton anagnoste."�
�Te Bretania pou anedeixe te Margkaret Thatser os sumbolo enos sullogikou kakou kharaktera, perigraphei o Koou.
To "Ti oraio pliatsiko!" perilambanei mia seira apo bretanikes eikones kai stereotupa -gia na ta paramorphosei kai na ta exothesei sto geloio: tis megales aristokratikes oikogeneies pou sparassontai anaimakta (e aimatera), tis ekkentrikes gries, ta stoikheiomena arkhontika, oloklero to gkran gkiniol tes astikes taxes, s' ena basileio kathe allo para enomeno, (...) opou "katestemeno" einai e adusopete oikonomike exousia.
Diabazontas ton Koou, thumatai kaneis mia phrase apo te Muriel Spark: "Tote, prin apo polu kairo, to 1945, oloi oi kaloi anthropoi ste Bretania etan phtokhoi..." Auto uposterizei ki o Koou: oi kaloi tou anthropoi einai phtokhoi, eupatheis kai ekplektoi.
(Apo to epimetro tes Sotes Triantaphullou)"�
�Anyone working to improve the childbearing experience and help women avoid unnecessary intervention has encountered numerous obstetric myths or old doctors' tales. And while the evidence in the medical literature may be solidly, often unequivocably, against whatever the doctor said, without access to that evidence, the pregnant woman is quite reasonably going to follow her doctor. This book is an attempt to make the medical literature on a variety of key obstetric issues accessible to people who lack the time, expertise, access, or proximity to a medical library to research concerns on their own. This compact, accurate, yet understandable reference is designed for people without medical training and organized for easy access.
After an introductory chapter giving basic information about the different types of medical studies, how to evaluate them, and some basic statistical concepts, Goer provides chapters on cesarean issues, pregnancy and labor management, and a review of alternative approaches. Each chapter begins with a stated myth, followed by an examination of the reality. Goer then analyzes the mainstream belief, pointing out its fallacies. Then comes a list of significant points gleaned from the studies and keyed to her abstracts. Next is the outline by which the abstracts are grouped. Finally come the numbered abstracts of relevant articles published, in most cases, after 1980. The book concludes with a glossary of medical terms and an index. This compact, accurate, and understandable reference tool is designed for people without medical training as well as care givers."�
�Gia ton astunomo Kharito ta kala nea erkhontai ena ena. Ta kaka, ola mazi. Den prolabainei na kharei gia to didaktoriko tes Katerinas, tes kores tou, kai aute pephtei thuma tromokratikes energeias. Agnostoi katalambaoun ena ploio exo apo te Souda kai kratane omerous triakosious epibates. O Kharitos trekhei sten Krete gia na parakolouthesei apo konta ten epikheirese diasoses ton omeron. Ten idia stigme omos, enas maniakos sten Athena arkhizei na skotonei diaphemistes sta Mesa Mazikes Enemeroses. O Kharitos epistrephei sten Athena kai prospathei na anakalupsei kai na sullabei ton dolophono, pou thelei na tinaxei to teleoptiko sustema ston aera, eno to mualo tou einai sten Krete, konta sten kore tou..."�
�To muthistorema "Ta stoikheiode somatidia" aphegeitai ten istoria tou dutikou kosmou sta teleutaia trianta pente khronia. Protagonistes tou bibliou duo eterothale adelphia, o Misel kai o Mprouno. O Misel, biologos ereunetes, anikanos n' agapesei, zei ten parakme tes sexoualikotetas tou epikentromenos ste douleia, sto souper market kai sta eremistika. Kapote, ostoso, oi epistemonikes anakalupseis tou tha semanoun te metamorphose tou kosmou. O allos adelphos, o Mprouno, anazetei apegnosmena te sexoualike apolause sto esoteriko organomenon topon edones. Tha katorthosei arage na proseggisei ten eutukhia pou akhna diaphainetai se mia kainourgia skhese; E tarakhodes oikogeneiake kai sunaisthematike diadrome ton duo adelphon perigraphei parastatika ten autoktonia tes Duses -isos, omos, kai na exaggelei ten aparkhe mias metallaxes tou anthropou."�
�Sto Emerologio Proseukhes apotuponetai e poreia mesa apo ten opoia sugkroteitai e suggraphike autosuneidese tes Phlanneru O'Konnor. Stis eggraphes autou tou neanikou tetradiou, to opoio anakaluphtheke prosphata, e O'Konnor suneidetopoiei stadiaka ton proorismo tes, mesa apo mia idiotupe kai apolutos prosopike morphe proseukhes. Sto epikentro tes pneumatikes tes agonias brisketai e anagke tes na sunduasei ten kallitekhnike demiourgia me te mustike skhese me ton Theo, apo ton opoio zeta diarkos te khare pou tha te boethesei na ginei spoudaia suggrapheas.
E Phlanneru O'Konnor (1925-1964) einai mia apo tis semantikoteres Amerikanides suggrapheis. Ta themata tes peristrephontai guro apo te zoe ston amerikaniko Noto kai einai diapotismena apo te bathia katholike tes piste. Egrapse duo muthistoremata, trianta duo diegemata, dokimia kai kritikes."�
�Apo to 1893 mekhri to 1896, o nearos Proust akonizei ta makhairia tou os suggrapheas sto periodiko Revue blance. Auta ta keimena pou den tha sumperilephthoun ste sulloge "Terpseis kai emerai", to proto biblio pou ekdotheke to 1896 apo ton Proust, proseggizoun themata pou tha diatrexoun apo ten arkhe os to telos to ergo tou "Anazetontas to khameno khrono"."�
�Enas muthistoriographos pou graphei astunomikes istories me pseudonumo apophasizei na parastesei ton -agnosto tou- ntetektib Paul Auster. Kata te diarkeia tes ereunas tou, parakolouthei enan elikiomeno kurio -khoris na einai bebaios oti pragmati prokeitai gi' auton pou tha eprepe na parakolouthei- stis boltes tou ste Nea Uorke, kai semeionei me prosokhe tis diadromes tou gia na diabasei to menuma pou graphoun ta bemata tou parakolouthoumenou. Uparkhei, omos, pragmati kapoio menuma se autes tis diadromes e mepos o ntetektib-pou-den-einai-ntetektib diabazei opos thelei tukhaies grammes kai skhemata; Ektos ki an arkei aute tou e anagnose gia na papsoun oi grammes na einai tukhaies.
Sten pio sumbatike tes ekdokhe, e nouar istoria ekhei kathara diatupomena erotemata -krummena sten kapna, esto- pou entelei briskoun apantese- kai oi eroes mporei na einai ligotero e perissotero poluplokoi, sarkinoi e khartinoi, pantos e tautoteta tous -para tis ekastote metamphieseis, aposiopeseis, upekphuges, para ta opoia tekhnasmata tou suggraphea- einai kathare e xekatharizei otan pia phtanoume sto telos: ste these tou agnostou Kh mpainei ena prosopo. Sten osterike ekdokhe tou nouar, oi sunethismenes eroteseis den pairnoun apantese -den einai kan oi katalleles eroteseis, autes pou endiapheroun ton suggraphea- to <>mporei na einai <>- ki isos ki autos pou rotaei na einai o idios ena erotematiko. Me alla logia, edo to musterio einai e idia e kardia tes uparxes -kai os ek toutou, e anazetese tes luses sunekhizetai polu meta ten teleutaia selida.
Etsi, akoma kai e Nea Uorke, skhedon monimo phonto sto ergo tou Auster, einai tautokhrona mia apeikonise tes pragmatikes poles, ena skeniko, kai ena blue screen: mia reuste pole gia reustous anthropous pou kleidonontai se kapoio apo ta anarithmeta domatia tes e pou parakolouthoun o enas ton allon kornizomenoi se antikrista parathura, khoris telika na xeroun poios parakolouthei poion -ena sustema ateleioton antikatoptrismon- enas kambas gematos skhemata gia ta opoia den mporeis na eisai sigouros oti den einai tukhaies grammes pou tis diabazeis san skhemata, opos o ntetektib-pou-den-einai-ntetektib."�
�E Menli Nikols den eikhe papsei pote na katakrinei ton eauto tes gia ton tragiko thanato tou dikhronou giou tes Mpompi se ena atukhema, molo pou den euthunotan ekeine. O gamos tes me ton Antam kinduneuei na dialuthei. Ostoso e gennese tes kores tous Khana dinei kai stous duo to kouragio na prospathesoun na sosoun te skhese tous. Apophasismenoi na xanakhtisoun te zoe tous se nees baseis, pegainoun na perasoun to kalokairi sto Keip Kont. Den xeroun omos oti ekei, kapoios apo to periballon tous ekhei polu diaphoretika skhedia gia to mellon tous.
Apo ten prote stigme tes egkatastases tous sto <>, mia epaule tou dekatou ogdoou aiona, paraxena pragmata arkhizoun na sumbainoun. Atukhemata, pou xanaphernoun sten kardia tes Menli ton tromo tou dustukhematos opou ekhase ton Mpompi kai ten kanoun na phobatai gia te Khana. Tautokhrona, mera me te mera, emplekontai s' ena skoteino kai apeiletiko isto gegonoton pou sugklonizoun te phainomenika esukhe pole. Kai, khoris na to katalaboun, tha brethoun sto epikentro mias diabolikes plektanes pou den ekhei stokho mono ten psukhike isorropia tes Menli alla kai ten idia te zoe tes..."�
�Kleismenos sto domatio tou ste sophita, o dodekakhronos Nteibint threnei gia to thanato tes meteras tou. Einai thumomenos kai monos. Monadike tou suntrophia ta biblia tou sta raphia, pou ekeine ton emathe n' agapa. Alla mes sto skotadi auta ta biblia arkhizoun na tou psithurizoun. Ki oso tou miloun, pragmatikoteta kai phantasia ginontai siga siga ena...
Kathos e oikogeneia tou dialuetai, o Nteibint, niothei tous psithurous sta raphia na ton traboun biaia s' enan allo kosmo -mia paraxene antanaklase tou dikou tou, pou katoikeitai apo eroes kai terata ki ena gerasmeno basilia pou krubei ta mustika tou s' ena ainigmatiko biblio: "To biblio ton khamenon pragmaton"...
Ena skoteino paramuthi gia te thlipse kai ten apoleia, ten aphosiose kai ten agape. Gia to makru, tromaktiko taxidi apo ten athooteta sten enelikiose. Kai gia ten akatalute duname ton muthon ste zoe mas."�
�Gia ten astunomia pou ton sullambanei os diarrekte, o Mpil Kaizer einai enas paraphron pou prepei na metapherthei sten pteruga epeigonton psukhiatrikon peristatikon tou nosokomeiou Mpelbi. Gia te nosokoma pou ton phrontizei, einai enas antras pou ekhei epanastatesei kata tes adikias. Gi'auto kai tha ginei sunenokhos tou, anakaluptontas oti prokeitai gia enan mago ton upologiston kai megalophuia ste khemeia ton ekrektikon ulon, pou ekhei keruxei polemo stous kratountes megistanes tes Neas Uorkes."�
�Ston "Kleisto kuklo" emphanizontai xana oi epheboi eroes tes "Leskhes ton tipotenion". Einai omos eikosi khronia megaluteroi. Briskomaste sta tele tes dekaetias tou '90, epokhe tou Tonu Mplair, se mia polupolitismike pleon Bretania, piste summakho kai sunodoiporo ton EPA stis polemikes tous epikheireseis. E oikonomike anaptuxe kai e katapolemese tes anergias antistathmizontai apo ten auxanomene anisoteta kai tis oloena oxunomenes koinonikes kai phuletikes entaseis.
Gia mia akome phora, o Tzonathan Koou plathei exairetika endiapherontes anthropinous kharakteres, oi opoioi paleuoun na katanoesoun ta diakhronika problemata pou ekhoun na kanoun me ton erota, ten aphosiose kai ten oikogeneia. O Koou parakolouthei tis erotikes tous istories, ta pathe kai tis apogoeteuseis tous, ten ekplerose e te diapseuse ton prosdokion tous, meletontas parallela me te gnoste tou oxuderkeia ten poreia tes bretanikes koinonias s' enan kosmo pou allazei kai se mia epokhe opou politike kai theatro ekhoun ginei skhedon ena."�
�Topothetemene sten epinoemene apo ton suggraphea, phantastike khora pou kapoioi onomasan "Gkrinlantia", e noubela tou Alexantr Gkrin uiothetei ten tekhnike tes paraboles kai ten atmosphaira tou paramuthiou gia na aphegethei mia muthike istoria agapes. E erotike aphupnise ton duo nearon eroon, tes Assol kai tou Gkreu, kai e poreia pros ten ekplerose tou erota tous dinontai mesa apo lampres perigraphes tes phuses kai arkhetupikous sumbolismous. Ostoso, se ena deutero epipedo, os basiko thema tou keimenou proballei e antithese anamesa sten peze, ekhthrike pragmatikoteta kai ten alethine zoe: ton kosmo tou oneirou kai tes epithumias."␀␀ @"	333333@"	333333@"	=
